Subject: [PATCH 4/5] chore(fork): drop the em-client CardDAV patches, no
 longer needed

The two CardDAV sync-collection fixes for eM Client are no longer
required - fixed either upstream or in eM Client itself - confirmed by
running stock upstream in production with no regression. Genericizes
the fork tooling (patches dir, check recipe, release tag naming) away
from em-client-specific naming since the patch stack is no longer
about CardDAV.
